# Free / local parity verifier outputs — the trades CSV is regenerable
# bulk; the small summary JSON / markdown may be committed by the user
# if they choose, but the trade list is always gitignored.
research/parity_verifier/results/**/trades.csv

# Backtrader secondary-lane outputs — raw trade/metrics dumps are
# regenerable bulk data and never committed. Only the small summary
# docs under docs/research/ are committed by the user.
